(registered 2026-10-13, last updated 2026-10-13)

Scheme name: sns

Status: provisional

Applications/protocols that use this scheme name:
Wallet and mail applications on the ORDnet stack (the ORD/plug wallet
extension, ORDnet mobile wallets, ORDmail) and web clients that link to
on-chain names. "sns" identifies an SNS name (sns:alex.web3) or a
mailbox at a name (sns:bob&alex.web3) per the adopted scheme
specification ODNCA-STD-005; deployed applications dereference it to
initiate a payment to the name's current holder or to compose mail to
the mailbox, always behind an explicit user confirmation. The successor
specification (ODNCA-STD-011, public draft) narrows the scheme to the
payment action; existing URIs remain valid — this registration will be
updated on its adoption.

